Section 2(y), Sections 3 & 4 of the 2015 Act are reproduced hereinbelow as follows:-
2.(y) "reclassification" means change of land use from agricultural purpose to intended non-agricultural purpose and "reclassified land" means land for which permission under this Act is granted for use for non-agricultural purpose;
